        {
          "textRaw": "[m] load",
          "name": "[m]_load",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "load(messageSource, locale)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "load",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Overload 1/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>messageSource</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">Object</a> } - 消息键值对象</li>\n<li><strong>locale</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 消息所属的区域设置</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#void\">void</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把消息对象加载到底层消息存储.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">i18n.load({\n    greeting: &#39;Hello, $1!&#39;,\n}, &#39;en&#39;);\ni18n.setLocale(&#39;en&#39;);\nconsole.log(i18n(&#39;greeting&#39;, &#39;AutoJs6&#39;));\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "messageSource"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "locale"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "load(messageSource, locale?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "load",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Overload 2/2</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>messageSource</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 区域设置名称或 JSON 文件路径</li>\n<li><strong>[ locale ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 消息所属的区域设置</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#void\">void</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>从 JSON 文件加载消息.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>messageSource</strong> 不含系统路径分隔符时, 文件解析为 <code>&lt;消息目录&gt;/&lt;messageSource&gt;.json</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>messageSource</strong> 含系统路径分隔符时, 将其作为文件路径解析.</li>\n<li>省略 <strong>locale</strong> 时, 同时使用 <strong>messageSource</strong> 作为区域设置标识.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>文件不存在, 文件不是普通文件或 JSON 解析失败时抛出异常. JSON 解析失败时还会向控制台写入警告.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "messageSource"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "locale?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] load"
        },
